  steps(T('Each holder shares one slip at a time. Hear all three independent reports.','持卡者逐张分享，听完三份独立记录。'),T('Choose one top, one dial and one base by their pictures and feature words.','按图案和特征名称选择顶部、刻度盘、底座各一张。'),T('Standard: place the three cards below. Low-cut: keep page 8 whole and write/draw the three features below.','标准：把三张卡摆到下面。少裁剪：第8页整页保留，在下面写或画特征。'),T('Point from each choice to its original slip; a picture alone is not evidence.','每项选择都要指出原卡，不能只凭插图猜。')),special('assembly'),
